// A `priv` member of a jet.runtime interface module is Core's alone: the
// runtime declares `#Import(c) priv argv`, and the generated interface keeps
// the `priv`. A call from any other package is the ordinary visibility error
// (E0605), not E1004's "has no item".
use proc: jet.runtime.process

run: fn() {
    _: proc.argv()
}
